There is an optimal set of ?oGD for detecting the plane portals.  For
water, you are best off with cursed so that you can orient yourself in
only one move.  The Bell or a wand of SDD can then be used if multiple
bubbles are connected.  For air and earth, a cursed or uncursed scroll
is fine but I prefer cursed and then remember where I saw the $ sign
appear.  For fire, a cursed ?oGD is bad.

